{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game About Penguins</strong> is a cozy, online multiplayer sandbox where you play as a customizable penguin and dive into hilarious, heartwarming adventures with your friends. Explore snowy landscapes, play mini-games, and express yourself in the cutest way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/1c3e255cce7c466f09fc9599508f8152.webp?t=1762452599\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Waddle through snowy villages, slide down icy hills, or give your friends a playful slap to send them tumbling. It\u2019s all part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/c9294637503883f6d98b1aba33b18a6d.poster.avif?t=1762452599\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/c9294637503883f6d98b1aba33b18a6d.webm?t=1762452599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/c9294637503883f6d98b1aba33b18a6d.mp4?t=1762452599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/39eca8c6f2983ab81b4f14f7272adc28.webp?t=1762452599\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cast your line and relax as you fish in icy waters. Catch rare creatures, fill your journal, and earn rewards along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/fc0ffbdd4e1ba18150a345d83dbc79c2.poster.avif?t=1762452599\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/fc0ffbdd4e1ba18150a345d83dbc79c2.webm?t=1762452599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/fc0ffbdd4e1ba18150a345d83dbc79c2.mp4?t=1762452599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/c5414cb51de63622291cf61e8dad02f4.webp?t=1762452599\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock outfits, colors, hats, and accessories to create your own unique penguin style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/ea9cbbd96d8aa65d189af9f9d24ba8ec.poster.avif?t=1762452599\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/ea9cbbd96d8aa65d189af9f9d24ba8ec.webm?t=1762452599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061800/extras/ea9cbbd96d8aa65d189af9f9d24ba8ec.mp4?t=1762452599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor